OL,3,GNEWSAHospital doctors to strike as pay
OL,4,Adispute continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FHospital doctors in Northern Ireland
OL,7,Fare to strike in November over pay.
OL,9,FIt comes after the Royal College of
OL,10,FNursing announced that it is also
OL,11,Fballoting its members on potential
OL,12,Fstrike action.
OL,14,FThe doctors will stage two separate
OL,15,F24-hour strikes on 20 and 23 November.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
