OL,3,GNEWSAHospital doctors to strike as pay
OL,4,Adispute continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe British Medical Association (BMA)
OL,7,Fhas warned doctors are prepared to
OL,8,Fescalate the strike action if progress
OL,9,Fis not made in addressing the pay
OL,10,Fissue, which they say has seen doctors'
OL,11,Fpay drop from upwards of 26% over the
OL,12,Fpast 18 years due to below inflation
OL,13,Fpay awards.
